{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34167","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 投龙潭 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 投龙潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名山潭洞中，自古多秘邃。\n君将接神物，聊用申祀事。\n熔金象牙角，尺木无不备。\n亦既奉真官，因之徇前志。\n持来展明诰，敬以投嘉瑞。\n鳞光焕水容，目色烧山翠。\n吾皇病秦汉，岂独探幽异。\n所贵风雨时，民皆受其赐。\n良田爲巨浸，污泽成赤地。\n掌职一不行，精灵又何寄。\n唯贪血食饱，但据骊珠睡。\n何必费黄金，年年授星使。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}